/*!
    \namespace vsmm
    \inmodule VSMM
    \brief Every class of the backend.

    Each library under \c src builds one shared library with its classes in
    this namespace. The \c I prefixed classes are abstract interfaces. Most
    libraries use other libraries only through these interfaces, so tests
    can replace a collaborator with a mock.
*/
